Klaas Kuiken, Petra Vos-Pothoven, Nienke van der Peijl and many others at Dialoog Nederlandse Les.\\
You could visit our website www.dialoognederlandseles.nl or send us an email at info@dialoonglnederlanseles.nI. We will try to keep up the good work but feel free to give any suggestions how to improve things. Maybe you miss certain topics? Or maybe there are too many grammar explanations and not enough dialogues? Whatever you think, please tell us! Your input would be very welcome.\\

Dialoog wants to thank everyone who has helped making this project possible. This includes those students whose names were used in the dialogues throughout this book, teachers from other schools, friends and relatives. Also a big thanks to Jan Bruijn and his wife Mieke Dekker from Accres Payroll Services (www.accres.eu). They made sure everything was taken care off behind the scenes which allowed us to focus purely on education and getting the best out of ourselves and therefore also out of our students. And lastly we want to thank anyone who spreads the word about Dialoog and helps us grow further into becoming one of the top institutes when it comes down to language training in Netherlands. Keep recommending us and we'll make sure to put in extra effort where needed to maintain high standards. Thanks again everyone!!! Klaas, Petra, Nienie and all others working together within Dialoog Institute.\\[2cm]

