\subsection*{Answers}
The total amount spent is $100.
If Ivan's original spending of $45 is increased by 50%, then his new spending will be:
$45 + (50% \text{of} \$45) = \$67.50. He spends $67.5 in total. The difference between his old and new spending amounts to \$22.50 more than before. Thus,
