\subsection*{Bonus Questions Answers}


For "product less than thousand and sum greater than thirty": Possible pair could be (32,31).
For "number added to negative seven giving twenty-three": Answer is thirty.
Three-digit number with digits totaling twenty and leaving remainder four upon division by five is eighty-four.
Solution to \( 140 + 60 = 800\) yields sixty-six.
Smallest even number meeting criteria is ten.
