\paragraph{Think With Me}
What happens when many people lose their job because of automation?

\paragraph{Talking Point}
Do you think all the things robots do today would still need doing if there were no more humans on Earth? Or would they just stop working one day like cars without petrol? Tell someone what you think.

\paragraph{\textbf{Bonus Question}}
Find three places near you (like shopping malls) that use robotics now. How does each place make good use of its ‘worker' machine?
