\item How could you reduce this amount of water usage?  
\end{enumerate} Write down some ideas to help solve these problems and suggest them to teachers, parents or guardians who can take action. Report on what they say about using less water. Share your results with other students in class. Find more ways that people use water around where you live, work and play. Is there any way people waste water around those areas? Describe three examples of wasting water. Suggest one solution for each example so that no water will be wasted again. Present it clearly as if you are explaining it to someone else. Now think of two places where there may not have enough clean safe drinking water available. Explain why lack of access to good quality water causes health issues among populations affected by such situations. Tell others how bad things would get without proper sources like rivers/lakes etc! Come up with creative solutions (like rainwater collection systems) & share findings orally/in written form alike - make sure everyone knows their part when saving precious resources!! We're all responsible afterall!!! Let's save our planet before time runs out...because once lost = gone forevermore sadly enough indeed unfortunately :((((((
 
