tration Destruction Habitats Loss Biodiversity Extinction Rate Species Reduction Greenhouse Gases Emissions Rising Temperatures Melting Ice Caps Glaciers Sea Levels Flooding Drought Forest Fires Extreme Storm Category Hurricanes Tornado Blizards Sandstorms Hail Storm Wild Bushfire….:).:)!!![STDPLNM]:)!!!:)!!!!!!!11!!:)!!!:)111!!!:)!!!!!!!!!!:)!!!!!!.scalablytypedHere are some suggestions for maps/diagrams/illustrations:

