<<799 Generation>> Ryan has \$15. He buys a pair of shoes priced at \$12.

\begin{enumerate}[label=\alph*.]
\item How much money does Ryan have left?
\end{enumerate}

Ryan also wants to buy a watch that costs \$23.
\begin {enumerate}[ label = \alph* ]
    \item Does he have enough money? Explain how you know.
\end {enumerate}
He then decides to save the rest of his money in a bank account instead of buying the watch, so he goes home without spending any more.

\subsection*{Answers}
