<<853 Generation>> Discuss with your friends what you could do to make people more aware that litter is an eyesore, kills wildlife and spoils our countryside. Share your ideas with the class. Which idea does everyone think would be most useful? Why? Write down the reasons given by two or three different pupils. Do you agree with them? Give your own opinion. Now choose one of these actions:
\begin{enumerate}[label=\alph*.]
